        "description": "GCP Pub/Sub ingest for SAP LogServ. Consumes Pub/Sub blob-created notifications, fetches each LogServ blob over a SAS, and emits its NDJSON for index-time routing. Install on Heavy Forwarders alongside the LogServ Data TA (which provides the sourcetype routing, filtering, and stamping). The GCP counterpart to the Splunk Add-on for AWS SQS-based S3 input.",
